<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dave &amp; Buster's.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dave &amp; Buster's.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson Stephens and Co analyst Andy Barish said he raised his fiscal 1998 estimate on Dave &amp; Buster's Inc to $1.45 a share from $1.35, citing strong first quarter results. Barish has a buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, the company reported first quarter earnings rose to $0.28 per share, up from $0.20 in the year ago period.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We continue to find Dave &amp; Busters attractive for its strong EPS growth potential, its leadership position in the restaurant/entertainment complex area and its relatively small base of units from with it can grow substantially,&quot; said Barish.</p>
</text>
